sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant ChatOrch
    participant Planner
    participant Writer
    participant Reviewer
    participant Ollama
    participant Milvus
    participant DOCX

    User->>ChatOrch: Start conversation
    ChatOrch->>Ollama: Generate response
    Ollama-->>ChatOrch: Questions
    ChatOrch-->>User: Gather information

    User->>ChatOrch: Provide answers
    ChatOrch->>Ollama: Continue
    Ollama-->>ChatOrch: Ready
    ChatOrch-->>User: Ready to generate

    ChatOrch->>Planner: Create plan
    Planner->>Ollama: LLM call
    Ollama-->>Planner: Plan

    Planner->>Writer: Write document
    Writer->>Milvus: Retrieve context
    Writer->>Ollama: Generate content
    Ollama-->>Writer: Sections

    Writer->>Reviewer: Review
    Reviewer->>Ollama: Quality check
    Ollama-->>Reviewer: Approved

    Reviewer->>DOCX: Generate document